    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπρόθεσμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beyond the appointed day,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὀφλήματος</span>
			<i>for</i> the debt, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				80
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῶν ἑπτὰ ἡμερῶν</span>
			<i>after</i> seven days have expired, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sat.</u>
				2
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τοῦ ἀγῶνος</span>
			<i>past the time of,</i> i.e. <i>too old for,</i> the games,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Anach.</u>
				39
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. φιλοτιμήματα</span> honours
				<i>deferred till too late,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Nav.</u>
				40
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.169
				</span></i>
			.</div>
